*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0033
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-04-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 221
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0033.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> STUDENT INDICATOR Y/N
    05 SF-IND             PIC X.
       88 SF-STUDENT VALUE 'Y'.
    05 WS-CAGE            PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 FW-IND             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 FW-WAIVED VALUE 'Y'.
    05 WS-MFEE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 2200-CONCESSIONS
    DISPLAY "FW-IND=" FW-IND
    DISPLAY "WS-MFEE=" WS-MFEE
    STOP RUN.
2200-CONCESSIONS.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER
        WHEN SF-STUDENT AND WS-CAGE < 24
            SET FW-WAIVED TO TRUE
            MOVE 0 TO WS-MFEE
        *> SENIOR FEE WAIVER
        WHEN WS-CAGE >= 65
            SET FW-WAIVED TO TRUE
            MOVE 0 TO WS-MFEE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 4 TO WS-MFEE
    END-EVALUATE.
